# ============================================================================
# SUPERSEDED — use deploy/nginx/tableflow.markui.lk.conf instead.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file is kept only so older links to it lead somewhere. Do not deploy it.
# Three things in it are wrong for this app:
#
#   1. `proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;`
#      APPENDS the real IP after any value the client sent. rate-limit.ts reads
#      the FIRST entry, so a client that sends its own X-Forwarded-For gets a
#      fresh rate-limit bucket on every request. The replacement overwrites the
#      header with $remote_addr.
#
#   2. `proxy_set_header Connection "upgrade";` is sent on EVERY request,
#      including plain HTTP, which breaks keepalive. The replacement uses a
#      map on $http_upgrade (deploy/nginx/tableflow-map.conf).
#
#   3. X-Forwarded-Host is never set. requestHost() in src/server/db/tenant.ts
#      reads it first to resolve the tenant, and requestOrigin() in
#      src/lib/tenant-url.ts builds every printed QR and receipt URL from it.
#
# It also has no TLS block and no long read timeout for /socket.io/, so
# realtime connections drop against server.mjs's 25s ping interval.
# ============================================================================
